ure, and actionable insights.","Discovery surfaces contradictions, edge cases, and unmet needs.","By connecting research, content, and interaction patterns, I build a shared picture of the product that whole teams can rally around.","Synthesis turns them into structured flows, wireframes, and a clear direction.",{"_uid":81,"heading":82,"component":83,"paragraph":84,"archetypes":85,"paragraphTwo":143,"paragraphThree":144},"b61a9082-c3a6-4d9b-b0dd-9232729ecc45","Feedback\nthat answers","AlephDigitalTwin","I test multiple directions in parallel — comparing real tasks, accessibility, and edge cases before committing to one.",[86,91,95,99,103,107,111,115,119,123,127,131,135,139],{"_uid":87,"title":88,"number":89,"component":90},"d75c6a8b-5fa3-492a-a9a7-38e5a38fcbcf","Quick to \nabandon a flow","73","AlephArchetype",{"_uid":92,"title":93,"number":94,"component":90},"ea6da649-7525-47f8-a4b5-3d8cd8989e39","Questions \nassumptions","68",{"_uid":96,"title":97,"number":98,"component":90},"3acacdf7-0729-4f47-a5a5-ba2f717718bb","Resistant to \nrough edges","12",{"_uid":100,"title":101,"number":102,"component":90},"7fc1f838-fdc1-4d25-abd3-4d9c653aeef6","Thinks in \nedge cases","84",{"_uid":104,"title":105,"number":106,"component":90},"364c3c7d-8ebe-4e28-839f-97c5cec7f269","Finds order \nin ambiguity","49",{"_uid":108,"title":109,"number":110,"component":90},"2576e77a-4154-4dca-935b-ad5a9bbec199","Fast \ndecision-maker","62",{"_uid":112,"title":113,"number":114,"component":90},"5371099d-2fe3-4dde-9a00-537002f332b4","Adapts well \nto new tools","77",{"_uid":116,"title":117,"number":118,"component":90},"eddbd098-1b08-40ea-9e1c-e5d98ab98f59","Prefers \nquiet consensus","25",{"_uid":120,"title":121,"number":122,"component":90},"f726ad72-448c-45e8-a31b-e585610549b6","Calm under \ntight deadlines","91",{"_uid":124,"title":125,"number":126,"component":90},"4410ea47-21ad-4aeb-99f9-32396a0f0b21","Open to \nshared ideas","54",{"_uid":128,"title":129,"number":130,"component":90},"c5a8d88b-f48c-493c-8b29-f4fe385d4c61","Needs a \nclear next step","38",{"_uid":132,"title":133,"number":134,"component":90},"786c9624-988b-4836-bb5e-52fefe93ab43","Natural \nfacilitator","86",{"_uid":136,"title":137,"number":138,"component":90},"9b5b495b-2399-4975-871b-8e7a7f34cbe7","Tests with \nreal people","43",{"_uid":140,"title":141,"number":142,"component":90},"4de9d6db-0140-455a-954b-a8b3cb2ab45d","Willing \nto prototype","29","Prototypes and usability sessions simulate end-to-end journeys before production code is written. ","Great design should not wait. I move from insight to usable prototype quickly, so teams can validate ideas while they still matter.",{"_uid":146,"component":147,"paragraph":148},"f8f4234d-8587-4a6d-8ad7-3f855110440f","AlephQuantumCircuit","Ideas tested. Patterns found. Better decisions, faster.",{"_uid":150,"title":151,"heading":152,"component":153,"paragraph":154},"809488af-f837-4925-a9d1-2b1c63e92688","One Size Does Not Fit All","Outcome\nUnderstood\nTogether\n","AlephTreatment","Every product and audience is different. I tailor the process, the system, and the details to fit the people you serve.",{"_uid":156,"button":157,"heading":162,"component":163,"paragraph":164,"headingTwo":165,"paragraphTwo":166},"d682e5db-a1b9-44cb-a291-27662efb856f",{"id":28,"rel":28,"url":158,"title":159,"linktype":160,"fieldtype":161,"cached_url":158},"#","Start a Conversation","url","multilink","Let's build\nsomething clear","AlephWaitlist","Have a product that needs clarity? I would love to hear about it and explore how we can work together.","Thanks for reaching out. I’ll be in touch soon.","Thanks for reaching out. I’ll be in touch soon to talk about what you are building.","AlephPage","aleph",null,0,[],"3f004d9f-333b-414f-b245-a94a5a0ff9c6","2024-08-08T11:02:19.903Z","default",[],1759273223720]